            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "AI agents could multiply cyber risk, warns Zscaler CEO",
            "description": "<p><strong>You can catch Opening Bid on </strong><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/opening-bid/id1749109417\"><strong>Apple Podcasts</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/6blmkje6G8vLF8cVSWxa5A\"><strong>Spotify</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLx28zU8ctIRrPPoWZxI2uK-uEGDIx0DDD&feature=shared\"><strong>YouTube</strong></a><strong>, or wherever you get your podcasts.</strong></p>\n<p>AI is moving from chat to agents that act on your behalf\u2014and that shift could multiply cyber risks tenfold. Zscaler (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ZS\">ZS</a>) CEO Jay Chaudhry explains why securing agent-to-agent and agent-to-app communication is the hardest problem in cybersecurity, and how the company\u2019s Zero Trust Exchange already protecting over 50 million users is positioned to solve it. Watch the full interview on Opening Bid Unfiltered</p>\n<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/6blmkje6G8vLF8cVSWxa5A?si=13c787846e704eaa\">Listen</a> on your favorite podcast platform or<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\"> watch</a> on our website for full episodes of Opening Bid.</p>\n<p><em>This post was written by Langston Sessoms, producer for Opening Bid.</em></p>",
            "summary": "You can catch Opening Bid on Apple Podcasts, Spotify, YouTube, or wherever you get your podcasts. AI is moving from chat to agents that act on your behalf\u2014and that shift could multiply cyber risks tenfold. Zscaler (ZS) CEO Jay Chaudhry explains why securing agent-to-agent and agent-to-app communication is the hardest problem in cybersecurity, and how the company\u2019s Zero Trust Exchange already protecting over 50 million users is positioned to solve it. Watch the full interview on Opening Bid Unfiltered Listen on your favorite podcast platform or watch on our website for full episodes of Opening Bid. This post was written by Langston Sessoms, producer for Opening Bid.",
